{"product_id":"chuck-klosterman-iv-a-decade-of-curious-people-and-dangerous-ideas","title":"Chuck Klosterman IV: A Decade of Curious People and Dangerous Ideas","description":"\u003cp\u003eComing off the breakthrough success of Sex, Drugs, and Cocoa Puffs and Killing Yourself to Live, bestselling pop culture guru Chuck Klosterman assembles his best work previously unavailable in book form‰ÛÓincluding the groundbreaking 1996 piece about his chicken McNuggets experiment, his uncensored profile of Britney Spears, and a previously unpublished short story‰ÛÓall recontextualized in Chuck‰Ûªs unique voice with new intros, outros, segues, and masterful footnotes.Chuck Klosterman IV consists of three parts:Things That Are True‰ÛÓProfiles and trend stories: Britney Spears, Radiohead, Billy Joel, Metallica, Val Kilmer, Bono, Wilco, the White Stripes, Steve Nash, Morrissey, Robert Plant‰ÛÓall with new introductions and footnotes.Things That Might Be True‰ÛÓOpinions and theories on everything from monogamy to pirates to robots to super people to guilt, and (of course) Advancement‰ÛÓall with new hypothetical questions and footnotes.Something That Isn‰Ûªt True At All‰ÛÓThis is old fiction. There‰Ûªs a new introduction, but no footnotes. Well, there‰Ûªs a footnote in the introduction, but none in the story.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 214\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Chuck Klosterman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780743284899\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 432\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45262384005273,"sku":"16RB-3-9780743284899","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67e80033377c3_Chuck_20Klosterman_20IV-_20A_20Decade_20of_20Curious_20People_20and_20Dangerous_20Ideas_20Chuck_20Klosterman.jpg?v=1743436365","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/chuck-klosterman-iv-a-decade-of-curious-people-and-dangerous-ideas","provider"